                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>When a living creature is bitten by a weary, the undead infects the living flesh with the exhaustion of the grave. The creature bitten must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:16] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 round (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 2} for 1 round on a critical failure).</p>"
